  "meta": {
    "description": "Butler, Philbrick, Gordillo & Varadi's AAA: each month-end, hold the 5 of 10 asset-class ETFs with the best 126-day total return, weighted by a long-only minimum-variance portfolio whose covariance combines 126-day correlations with 20-day volatilities. Always fully invested; positions under 2% are dropped. Run as 4 equal tranches deciding 5 sessions apart, to remove rebalance-timing luck.",
